{"words": [{"text": "وَقَـٰتِلُوهُمْ", "translation": "And fight (against) them"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَكُونَ", "translation": "(there) is"}, {"text": "فِتْنَةٌۭ", "translation": "oppression"}, {"text": "وَيَكُونَ", "translation": "and becomes"}, {"text": "ٱلدِّينُ", "translation": "the religion"}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ ۖ", "translation": "for Allah"}, {"text": "فَإِنِ", "translation": "Then if"}, {"text": "ٱنتَهَوْا۟", "translation": "they cease"}, {"text": "فَلَا", "translation": "then (let there be) no"}, {"text": "عُدْوَٰنَ", "translation": "hostility"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "against"}, {"text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "the oppressors"}], "sahih": "Fight them until there is no [more] fitnah and [until] religion [i.e., worship] is [acknowledged to be] for Allāh. But if they cease, then there is to be no aggression [i.e., assault] except against the oppressors."}